lem; also called Silvanus. He and Judas, surnamed Barsabas, were chosen by the church there to accompany Paul and Barnabas on their return to Antioch from the council of the apostles and elders (Acts 15:22), as bearers of the decree adopted by the council.","verses":17,"father":"","mother":"","v":[1]},{"id":"holy_spirit_7400","name":"Holy Spirit","also":"Comforter, Holy Ghost","summary":"The third Person of the adorable Trinity.","verses":246,"father":"","mother":"","v":[5,6]}],"places":[{"id":"achaia_16","name":"Achaia","kind":"Region","lat":37.5,"lon":22.5,"summary":"The name originally of a narrow strip of territory in Greece, on the north-west of the Peloponnesus. Subsequently it was applied by the Romans to the whole Peloponnesus, now called the Morea, and the south of Greece.","verses":10,"v":[7,8]},{"id":"macedonia_747","name":"Macedonia","kind":"Region","lat":40.73292,"lon":22.9352,"summary":"In New Testament times, was a Roman province lying north of Greece. It was governed by a propraetor with the title of proconsul. Paul was summoned by the vision of the “man of Macedonia” to preach the gospel there (Acts 16:9).","verses":21,"v":[7,8]}],"events":[],"traditions":[],"sources":["Barnes","JFB","MHCC","Wesley"],"tags":{"bsb":[[3972,4610,2532,5095,3588,3588,1577,2331,2331,2331,1722,2316,3962,3962,2532,2962,2962,2424,5547,5485,2532,1515,4771,4771],[2168,2168,2168,2316,4012,3956,4771,4771,4160,4160,1909,1473,4335],[89,89,3421,1715,1473,2316,2532,3962,4771,2041,4102,4102,3588,2873,26,26,2532,3588,5281,1680,3588,1473,2962,2424,5547],[80,25,25,25,5259,2316,1492,1492,1589,1589,1589,1589,4771],[3754,1473,2098,1096,1519,4771,3756,3440,1722,3056,235,2532,1722,1411,1722,40,40,4151,2532,1722,4183,4136,2531,1492,1492,1096,1096,1722,4771,1223,1223,1223],[2532,4771,1096,3402,1473,1473,2532,3588,3588,2962,1209,1209,1209,3588,3056,3326,5479,5479,40,40,40,4151,1722,1722,1722,1722,4183,2347],[5620,5620,5620,4771,1096,1096,5179,5179,3956,3956,3588,4100,1722,3109,2532,882],[1063,3